Hi Avery,

We surveyed 3,200 sales leaders at B2B companies for our annual report. A few findings:

- Average sales cycle for deals over $25K grew 11% year over year
- 64% of buyers say they had already decided on a shortlist before talking to a rep
- Teams using AI for call notes and follow-ups report 5 hours saved per rep per week
- Founder-led sales is still the norm below $5M in revenue

Download the report: https://www.hubspot.com/state-of-sales-2026

Inside, you'll also find benchmarks for pipeline coverage, win rate and rep ramp time by company size.

